{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/header_control_mechanics_2.gif?t=1748714153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly destroyed, a delicate but highly advanced robot awakens to a city in crisis. A dominating robotics manufacturer has disappeared in the midst of addressing a dangerous malfunction in their models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What caused all this destruction? And can it be stopped?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What will you become to find out?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique movement mechanics allow a broken city to become your playground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of your small size and parasitic abilities to get the upper hand on challenging enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve innovative puzzles by redirecting power sources and manipulating the abilities of different robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear your way across diverse levels ranging from deserted industrial sites to luxury office complexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/bannercrawl.gif?t=1748714153\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\t<strong>CAUTION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Robots hate bugs. They will not hesitate to crush, burn, shock, soak, or otherwise destroy them on sight.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677860?t=1748714153","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677860?t=1748714153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/5e5477d947bf7505cbb3fd6343f2c76abfb8